<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n68805" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μόσσυν</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῡνος</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wooden house</i> or <i>tower</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξύλινοι μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aen.Tact.
					33.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ βασιλεὺς [τῶν Μοσσυνοίκων] ὁ ἐν
					τῷ μόσσυνι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					5.4.26
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σὺν τοῖς μοσσύνοις</span> (as if
			from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μόσσυνος</span>, nisi leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖν μοσσύνοιν</span>) ibid.; [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ Μοσσύνοικοι] οἰκοῦσιν ἐπὶ
					ξυλίνοις . . πύργοις . . , μόσσυνας αὐτὰ καλοῦντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					1.26
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				12.3.18
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>palisade</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				433
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> prob.
				<i>slip</i> for shipbuilding, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				1432
			</span></i>. [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μόσσῡνας</span> proved by the
			metre in <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				2.1017
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Aet.Oxy.</u>
				2080.70
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
			</span></i> ll.cc.: freq. written <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μόσυν</span>
			in codd.]</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
